{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1203,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6324957929fc2c696fe7a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真时髦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcad89b46e16af15b9740a6aee8e3a08b7f7dd92ef6f34457ca929ef1d2f3dc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec6414b2f7e29fbf3e33699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引擎全开，全力冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abb023b84ec3ca36a0c9efe6718779f5496d1bf56c008a4612d19a30e28ccc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fe8dc1139d0e5febe66cc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢漂亮的大姐姐吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd9d07413ba6193bf9a6c9c99718c49a9a2f11da82bbf32320eda4534f1b7b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fb31f277f4bca4b0c41b4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎随时找我约会喔。\r\n我会空下副驾驶座的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d442626597b4cd5736f63ada364e708c7cc319fd034c084802cd84c99e261e3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7146d634a662afdb3c9e6af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很「稀饭」学园的制服哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a64b58020a9acb4efd1ac8541283f4e0d32acc855b7b7e793989098ce9e19c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc26beab9a8f0940106a0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是穿上演唱会的服装\r\n就会觉得干劲高昂！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e246862f86730dd4831688e3109352cfc9f8bd15fd660e0480acc7ad6857b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d718289d6cea2889d19212a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火红的决胜服，\r\n连我的心情也跟着燃烧起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6370bbedd40fc87a416c0faf20cbf4b5f3ce1445e029102b9fe66757a0d88a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994c06ec35a58e66fd283882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟朋友和后辈们一起\r\n共度的学园生活……真是青春啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "325c47a0b61f7327c74aec2561a07452520d5ebe94d386e7cec7e0a062b04268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5be08ad44a4cf2100d1d1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会在领奖台上尽情表现的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b13d30ba4b8403032d35b426ca95b6bf79d94c9852600cd5af30fd400077ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8998b73dc02ffa4c9cde5ef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你看看，\r\n我用最高速越过终点的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f37e8092b9f501414b7d3de19a843e38d24c57dc6636bef9ce522694f187af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89e6d4604b57a45918f4e29f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如何？\r\n是不是又性感又可爱的超炫设计啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4330ffd0d98a72262ed1b4b06c56f4399dc4b9c0577c9beb233a80ad72f0af4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997e4c02791b5e3fc20d70e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这个就会忍不住想要跳舞呢～！\r\n咻──咻──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14264756f79229cccd7c8a2fa5851774d55b051a9cb609eb23c6ae546d098c32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a06b310a097a1db17d46aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真时髦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcad89b46e16af15b9740a6aee8e3a08b7f7dd92ef6f34457ca929ef1d2f3dc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a20143fa3938c46f4bc06f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引擎全开，全力冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abb023b84ec3ca36a0c9efe6718779f5496d1bf56c008a4612d19a30e28ccc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4b81b7e93f28d2f164433a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f38a26d2109e9836d01da3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，\r\n我要尽情地狂奔咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9b56ec14f3a9d3e3b451b16ce211aa0bf8b750d10caef38ffe97b1d817d694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d2047a65d9c24e6b06b18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引擎已经热起来了！\r\n你能跟上我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd59405cfc670d6989b6463b78cdcff2cbb5d56dce72f8d422214f26e2a89db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c77ead7ca122f266d4d4da88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊，训练员君！\r\n我今天也是\r\n整天都要把油门踩到底哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "77128709ecb237098600eba3cd25ac52fb1bb505d1e3706313bebfce364f20ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d2337b33062b3d8fee128d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要很有精神地迎接一整天\r\n的开始！那我们今天\r\n也尽全力加油加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad057ccf216066aa5377716bebcb7f5d7241437c1e407ec190c277f684452696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17be35570f438413ae9cf977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安！下午的训练\r\n也要打起精神努力进行哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03dc43dc2c369708923c3b7bbf5fa7223ba45cf35a74c85e0720ec1e3fadcfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:715dcf6c99e9294c5be1e25f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，训练员君。\r\n我已经做好要训练的准备了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d8495d7226a98c7d2d8a73b3a3520a4d5f939c5c2a446d6b958b2652dd1b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d12d07c9d34375bdf38e518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忙到这么晚，你辛苦了。\r\n为了不辜负你为了我的努力，\r\n我也会好好表现的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41298e37774b3e00515f49bb1cfd47d357caefaedba7990c5b82efbbc9a8bb73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e6c1a38ac7fb57c1d623da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道一个很时髦的夜景景点哦。\r\n等把该做的事情都做完后，\r\n我们就晚上去兜风吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7343ee12e85e25d79ca83073ab3435236ebdcc5ab16594b3ea77a11a6a42f7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43029c21fed1a28e41308c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了新进后辈们入学的\r\n时期了呢！我看手纲小姐也\r\n充满干劲的样子。\r\n呵呵，好期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b02727821692c7a8f893434fcd051d8199bdd3d709eb37782cac0bca6425ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:602b9c24883a47ddc2840056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天比起待在室内吹冷气，\r\n还是开车吹风比较舒服。\r\n想在海岸旁的道路上奔驰呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7dbfebb9809f47856aefb0307cc0399808929478b81a03f57ad285026417bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2888b36db6d0d4ec03177c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在积满落叶的赛道上\r\n全速奔跑是很有趣的哦。\r\n落叶飞舞的样子超棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d52789e4a12dc2f50ccf673bb099679ab89db3423c2542ea5131408ef298b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97849262d767ff8083aab96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变冷的时候，\r\n车上的电池就很容易没电……\r\n要好好保养维护才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1fc55f28c08dfd9999bd217b0ea149a0088cba835fb08c1f04df726af5c3741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b154dd01d29bb5cdf623df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊──！\r\n哎呀哎呀，你看起来很困呢～\r\n要一起去喝杯咖啡吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c069178cb40a628c1ead7aab80e851788cb14f29cde7f7923d4720b6833c64b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd9d3ab29b3c736bf1fe5523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的游泳池真是安静。\r\n……就我们两个独占这里一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfe084d555d4293d9809bef28c06730821b58f81d0e62c7cf923f46d6d46619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71fbd9b8b2d9639cd54a5575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多……\r\n想要来去一趟泡沫乐园了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d364e87de7c832b871f54eef3b834c041ed5de095f57998afb50ce57be93ed07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135d5b967ccd202d4307c14b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦咯♪如果还没吃午餐的话，\r\n就和我一起去吃意料吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23161d6bf3c540071b183710c9791f9443760e30a674c0581786a0b7be032842",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a80e7e8b8c55a527fd600aac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈寄来了满满整箱的东西哦。\r\n……呵呵，\r\n感动得有点想哭呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e794efb7e9340ede4be01f6b254cfe83f3dafdf8917d6bf64a0aa48954a59e03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad986eacd148e560970b089",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望可爱的后辈们，\r\n可以总是笑容满面的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3857f3276274bb1cd0a03a0fa95214e60919ace447c838990b6f9c9049704c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375b05305f6ba9461c36f490",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然白天赏花很好，\r\n但晚上赏花也很棒哦。\r\n……我来负责开车怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "253de2f398e351d07cd0c0e604acd4c44a2bdd30d1e91b62be5d483910f2dcc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f1eb77048b285699c228288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝天、白云！\r\n我们一起朝泡沫乐园出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae9f0a83286fa2981a043fee763ca2f639de7a879086fe06aa5b60b45b94193",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c0df4703adac45df33fcbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的月亮真漂亮。\r\n等我能喝酒的时候再陪我喝一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6c17c21aec9c3f0dc5ad7fb360cb10414e8c846a4b9eb28cffc2f1eed5dbaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f61d9999c1b25577d039c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对不会输给冷天气的！\r\n咻──咻──！唔，好冷！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80af25bc5e3383a89344a990e947b693f0cb1ab8bf68b53a5b4836d17775cddd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbdd7ddc8e1209a88c52ab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19284b425f82137176c73264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80bd25bdf062af5c73d1dc59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊，训练员！\r\n我今天也是\r\n整天都要把油门踩到底哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c85cc01408be32b1fd2de49f3928bbce006f1460ec69b5a2367391d855d35cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ead5ac45b24e347fd74ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，训练员。\r\n我已经做好要训练的准备了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c48e472a15bd9754bff438b56dd4dbcebbf3dc4765d7eb9ba88d67a169efd37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64052aca44b98c58a664b4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特今天也很有精神地在跑步呢。\r\n看到有这么可爱的后辈，\r\n就会忍不住想替她加油呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c6d90b081e490f4a1d54b49ab4f0ab725a7708196f99b66513304964e2c35d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6980cf76449985025f2bb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我妈妈打电话来跟我说她\r\n「发现了超赞的店」。\r\n我也不能错过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f4a64afe3cbca74f887fe9c1f497416d2908b5436e5d6bc0dde28d1ff01532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc8e9649cc0bc760417a3477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么热衷地来问我\r\n「要怎么应对后辈」……\r\n呵呵，鲁道夫也是蛮可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4f3702e62c078705dec4ec5c7ef449d91a4d3a490adcd12504362b931b793e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af8ffba604dd0f13327267e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然用自己的双脚奔跑也很舒服，\r\n但用爱车奔驰也别有一番风味呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6baf2a535aafdb8452cf3d902bed22255b68649c792d6b78b4e8a9a918256786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc4a3d8de9624f94a1fc620",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "驾照的照片真的很难拍得好看呢……\r\n我看我去找很会自拍的小Maya\r\n商量看看好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad306d43889eda9b0f16acf0da5f1e239bc60020f743a532940c493c070be46f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0068b5f2be848ed41eae342",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是观众们，我也希望\r\n演唱会能让包含训练员\r\n和我自己在内的所有人都开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8a2e41122e4931ac626dd424de4705c8d4428e5179021b43d5600dc63c5c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1b6a1dee0945349c95eb95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会除了唱歌，跳舞也很重要，\r\n对吧？聚光灯在我身上的时候，\r\n就得要热力四射才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b6348a6211c585f4c7dd9c16690d77a9659110cfe107d5109f37a7423fe63c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74005902d41532e23fd65b3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是奔驰在赛道上的「超跑」，\r\n一定要让大家看到\r\n不辜负这个名号的跑姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573713bf49b03c433b6fd7ce095f5e65759f108b705ba3087ce6f37500bb43c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb7fbf037b38426fe5866ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着酷炫的决胜服，就会心情整个都好起来♪\r\n想要快点全力冲刺呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7fd5973f5b2a0792fdc6c4e4a0efd001121f5c626826752f98e864e7828d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6592d31e6e3c6d7dfcde6733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定都会在早上淋浴。\r\n你看，尾巴的毛也很滑顺吧！\r\n想摸摸看吗？……呵呵，不～行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "821874b1c7d0714501867529a2ee8952a1ab9ea1d1c394dc6d14b20ea0acc429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbcb6ab032ec7eb6769b157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午吃了好多甜点啊。\r\n吃了提拉米苏、椰果……\r\n毕竟很流行嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "301409fcb67b2828ded9228f104f9d9476a681bbbd15c98ee701cf8b2056c79c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:047e0ac7ff073cbdd1ce7e70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上在安静的赛道上奔跑时，\r\n就能清楚听到风切声，\r\n会比平时更有速度感呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a061ca91b390dca0f713f6d38ffbd7cc685e6647c696f6a424466f8a79007e60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2561573326837ed0344f04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上赏樱也很棒哦。\r\n住宿舍的话因为有门禁，所以应该\r\n没什么机会看到，让我感觉很赚呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee3ba626f782b36fd6939bbb97a98ee1e2b9fe28f677fd415753c58a23b6d481",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc8038dde4483efe43f9f13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天雨多，很难开着车窗兜风。\r\n所以天气一好我就会去跑一下哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a227317d512a2a544d75633611bd4faa68120a52a68534791811861ceb32e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29c5341703591d8e24e8f67f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在满是红叶的道路上\r\n开着爱车奔驰……！\r\n光是想象就觉得好兴奋哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b97518b0339b0c93cb945e02e101f32b2254ac9b5f7913159005da04ccc7fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1778530dd5008f6dba168955",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的芭蕾舞是爸爸教的。\r\n以前冬天的时候，\r\n他常常让我练习「胡桃夹子」呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab932ef5bdb0fe809feab7ea813ea45d5136502cb8d3f77cfc151304105d085d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3a76730cfa0791d0e660e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休假的时候好像是好天气呢。\r\n干脆来洗我的塔酱好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f4d400142105940525f83a251df6e26743b197eb050e1051ae980884ff2f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c475efeeb3291e0f6ba0ef40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和妈妈什么都能聊哦♪\r\n我们之间就像朋友一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab863566fecc84dc229370be0d792d33e6f8f2ee667fb17be4a1e39a62ecbea9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef541d3ec5453fa9b9f3a2da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特吃饭时看起来很幸福的模样，\r\n真的很卡哇伊呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0865d0b6940e9aabaf6ab18ce5b5d4793da6c3bf8314303cbae4454ff44c5393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb0c99b11348ea4213476f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要释放压力的时候，\r\n就一定要去兜风呢！\r\n如何？今晚有空吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b21a2670417d9935dffc5e6a25cdba634435da0e17717b979b7c7acff663c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ad9f345fba3fede6d19295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小赤骥她真的是个很独立的人。\r\n……也因为这样，\r\n我总是忍不住想要对她好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b00bfe3612ecb94bd516c22d38bd71d6f859896c4330b1760dcb6a8a9e7019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2184466ec4c1f571f61d0222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊──！\r\n我梦到自己在舞厅热舞呢～♪\r\n今天状态非常棒哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca3f4457bc69f8c7257307ed741bdffaceaa61d26b27b0ac76273f821c60fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec8be031d8cb36d343c16eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨☆训练员君，\r\n你去过车站附近新开的喫茶店了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "518b933cfa55ffa4c03bcf078ee06ab708c10089d9c382cd83bbd15c17623a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4fe4bf2faf5a4bb8689761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想不想看看晚上的海？\r\n今晚的风感觉特别舒服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc621351eeaf73faf4f13f3debe40b82963dfafdd189110f92b5f0e767d47bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7767ceb2877745a8fa723b10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花飞舞的景色很棒吧？\r\n花瓣闪闪发亮得很漂亮。\r\n在底下热舞感觉应该会很棒♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e54474253c5c9a6a83538cc3a154f126c5e3ec0da06e71c3380d47ab369fd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5afe7c2e5ee284c181512a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去游泳池吗？还是海边？\r\n啊──还是我们干脆两种都去吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7934d46e6a59315c14a9b4d7c95156d4aeabe82cf832a7c6722e3b05eb941d46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c868248f3e7f6fc8f32044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里的佣人好像说过，\r\n这个时期的海里会有水母出没，\r\n所以不可以去海里玩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "039a091147f9bb54dfa3f7f3f027e729084e02709a4646b65aeca74a85d4b432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeac1aac78ec892fda778eeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你有兴趣尝试冬泳吗？\r\n哎呀，是想叫我别闹了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c929661092542e0f05b4295aaab769e9e95a818aad02905a0529e3d0499bc35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ed80b9ae99ee91f7e1acec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，重点是这个心型太阳眼镜。\r\n橘黄色的很卡哇伊吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51970be82b4363519e3fa9ad8cf2bb0471f3b33b6aad0bb5fcf722ad008bcf4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2e58a038bae006be929b7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还去做了指甲哦～\r\n这是叫做凝胶美甲吧？\r\n是可爱的后辈推荐我去的呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02fd5fe7a6f50b7207711f282ce837b16cfb2e757a9045f30a0f22112d94916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:215b639306142b54d701e253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨☆训练员，\r\n你去过车站附近新开的喫茶店了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df1f9768524e6b9e0658013aae77c6d7c04c0439b3bb985725f27ea96b883d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaccab0de013b18f031f734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是观众们，我也希望\r\n演唱会能让包含训练员\r\n和我自己在内的所有人都开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8a2e41122e4931ac626dd424de4705c8d4428e5179021b43d5600dc63c5c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8b24536c3538abd111ab19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我随时都是准备好的状态哦♪\r\n那要先从什么开始做起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a79bf97822b39caf42de3f98ab207a133666e9a3e4f580d25af07cfe8980b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afee127bf694b6b64c1626ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かっ飛ばすわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96df98365dc133a91a099cfc1b3e18085c0ee6dced36d26d3994349882d48f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d99be72bebcb7f6ae184a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～！\r\n我要尽情地加速了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccdee0feb015a42d2e7837781c6a6073d2aa8f8bef503df2a4cda765bc6a6105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab35fa2c16035cc5b1ddeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就尽情地\r\n去跑一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c9a8d3731700f87bc29fc5e1d9219c3be1e73f99da0f7bea5d04132bca6a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47722ba01c0494011330f0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正都要训练，\r\n就想让训练时间变得很愉快嘛。\r\n呵呵，麻烦你咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3afe9defedda68901c8ca332ee117ab58db0312edd87e992b4879f002c96a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a9954d7d6464ef07e2f8ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是你为我编排的训练项目，\r\n我全都可以。\r\n因为我每次都跑得很开心嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97a54f82ba0e43b3d9da634fdabd08cee49788aac1e7b242f8aed1360d3471",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0feb5064fb45e288fe24e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是你为我编排的训练项目，\r\n我全都可以。\r\n因为我每次都跑得很开心嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97a54f82ba0e43b3d9da634fdabd08cee49788aac1e7b242f8aed1360d3471",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
